{"parentUuid":"1e9d1a7a-95a8-4173-af5e-b232942feeef","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"a1623904b5d23ad05","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018DNqFpNb5qBsk7kvJyyJB3","type":"tool_result","content":"statement: >-\n  Hooks fire when a sub-agent starts and when it stops. The start hook cannot\n  block it; the stop hook's payload carries the sub-agent's own transcript\n  path and last message, and lists the session's background tasks.\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks#subagentstart\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks#subagentstart-input\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks#subagentstop\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks#subagentstop-input\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/meta\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/hookerrors\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/hookmix\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgagent\n  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\ncommit f860ff366b50328d62a3ff06a1cd76d39e84245f\nAuthor: Mykyta Svyrydenko <<redacted-email>>\nDate:   Sat Oct 3 16:44:15 2026 +0200\n\n    codex: bash-tool-result cell supported, recorded in runs/shell-exit-status (#91)\n    \n    Codex tells the agent a failed command's output like a success's; the failure is only in the event stream's command_execution item (status failed, exit_code). Recorded with the real codex; the cell lists that as a deviation, and the mock does the same.\n    \n    Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/shell_result_test.go      | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n codex-mock/internal/events/stream.go               |  7 ++-\n .../snapshots/runs/shell-exit-status/run.yaml      |  2 +\n .../shell-exit-status/samples/20261003-142833/SEAL |  6 ++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/events.jsonl           | 22 +++++++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/exit.txt               |  1 +\n .../samples/20261003-142833/payloads.jsonl         |  6 ++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/stderr.txt             |  1 +\n .../samples/20261003-142833/stream.jsonl           | 16 +++++\n ...8-34-01a1022a-acf2-7e12-9814-d1750d3ff095.jsonl | 28 +++++++++\n .../snapshots/runs/shell-exit-status/setup/hook.sh |  5 ++\n .../runs/shell-exit-status/setup/hooks.json        | 24 ++++++++\n .../runs/shell-exit-status/setup/prompt.txt        |  1 +\n spec/capabilities/bash-tool-result.yaml            | 16 ++++-\n 14 files changed, 204 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)\nadr:\ncapability-grounding\ncapability-once\nchild-processes\nfile-size\nlayering\nmock-config\nmodeled-surface\nmodules-cover-code\nstructured-files\n\ncodex-mock:\nMakefile\ne2e\nexec.go\ninternal\nmain.go\nsnapshots\n\ncursor-mock:\nMakefile\ne2e\ninternal\nmain.go\nroot.go\nrun.go\nsnapshots\ncodex-mock/snapshots/runs:\nhook-exit-codes\nhook-exit-json\nhook-matchers\nhook-timeout\nhook-unstartable\nnested-session-env\nposttool-block\npretool-decisions\nprompt-blocked\nschedule-wakeup-ask\nsession-end\nshell-exit-status\nstops\nsubprocess-session-env\n\ncursor-mock/snapshots/runs:\nadditional-context\nfile-tools\nhook-exit-codes\nhook-fail-closed\nhook-json-nonzero\nhook-matchers\nhook-timeout\nhooks-together\nnested-session-env\npretool-refusal\nschedule-wakeup-ask\nsession-start-block\nshell-exit-status\nstop-block-continuation\nsubprocess-session-env\nsymlinked-cwd\ntool-failure","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"46fe5f8d-51a3-4c21-b9cf-d3e35e8bb217","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:13:34.144Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1e9d1a7a-95a8-4173-af5e-b232942feeef","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a1623904b5d23ad05","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
