{"parentUuid":"e944c789-93cc-456b-bfef-b3089592515b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"a1623904b5d23ad05","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WbGNyThhErUDsVkLRtxKpk","type":"tool_result","content":"version: \"2026.09.28\"\ndocs:\n  https://cursor.com/docs/hooks:\n    version: 2026.09.28\n    sha256: 7294a2d63b19d79a5283c948afe174cba8b06a7585563d34a2c41b90f5df0d39\n  https://cursor.com/docs/cli/headless:\n    version: 2026.09.28\n    sha256: d767966f4e86012bce9e358c80c8a8e056d4ad0c8e73d74fd036d5acdf32a7af\ncursor-mock/internal/hooks/event.go:10:// afterAgentResponse, subagentStart/Stop, the MCP and Tab hooks, preCompact,\ninternal/tasks/reap.go:31:// sr:capability foreground-subagent-bash-ends-with-response\ninternal/subagents/hookpath.go:1:package subagents\ninternal/subagents/hookpath_test.go:1:package subagents\ninternal/subagents/dispatch_test.go:1:package subagents\ninternal/subagents/dispatch_test.go:16:\t\t{`{\"prompt\":\"p\",\"subagent_type\":\"x\"}`, []string{\"description\"}},\ninternal/subagents/dispatch.go:1:package subagents\ninternal/subagents/place.go:1:// Package subagents is the harness-neutral core of a nested agent run: where it\ninternal/subagents/place.go:4:package subagents\ninternal/subagents/place.go:27:// sr:capability subagent-transcripts\ninternal/subagents/place.go:57:// sr:capability nested-subagents\ninternal/subagents/handback.go:1:package subagents\ninternal/subagents/handback.go:18:// sr:capability foreground-subagent-result\ninternal/subagents/execute.go:1:package subagents\ninternal/subagents/execute.go:43:// sr:capability subagent-lifecycle-hooks\ninternal/subagents/execute.go:53:// sr:capability subagent-stop-block-loop\ninternal/subagents/cleanup.go:1:package subagents\ninternal/subagents/worktree.go:1:package subagents\ninternal/subagents/worktree.go:46:// sr:capability subagent-worktree-isolation\ninternal/subagents/cleanup_test.go:1:package subagents\ncursor-mock/e2e:\n001_hooks\n002_scenario\n\ncursor-mock/internal:\nchildenv\nhooks\nrunner\ntoolexec\n./run.yaml\n./setup/prompt.txt\n./setup/hooks.json\n./setup/hook.sh\n./samples/20261003-150041/stream.jsonl\n./samples/20261003-150041/SEAL\n./samples/20261003-150041/stderr.txt\n./samples/20261003-150041/payloads.jsonl\n./samples/20261003-150041/events.jsonl\n./samples/20261003-150041/exit.txt\n./samples/20261003-150041/transcript/3817895d-823b-481b-aa74-88e996df4942/3817895d-823b-481b-aa74-88e996df4942.jsonl\n#!/bin/sh\n# Every event logs its payload. The stop hook asks, the first time, for the\n# turn to go on: followup_message on its output, and an exit 2 on the second.\nIN=$(cat)\nprintf '%s\\n' \"$IN\" >>\"$HOOK_LOG\"\nEV=$(printf '%s' \"$IN\" | jq -r '.hook_event_name')\ncase \"$EV\" in\n  stop)\n    N=$(cat \"$TMPDIR/stopn\" 2>/dev/null || echo 0); N=$((N + 1)); echo $N >\"$TMPDIR/stopn\"\n    if [ $N = 1 ]; then echo '{\"followup_message\":\"STOP-FOLLOWUP-REASON\"}'; exit 0; fi\n    if [ $N = 2 ]; then echo \"STOP-EXIT2-REASON\" >&2; exit 2; fi ;;\nesac\nexit 0\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"hooks\": {\n    \"sessionStart\": [{ \"command\": \".cursor/hooks/hook.sh\" }],\n    \"sessionEnd\": [{ \"command\": \".cursor/hooks/hook.sh\" }],\n    \"preToolUse\": [{ \"command\": \".cursor/hooks/hook.sh\" }],\n    \"postToolUse\": [{ \"command\": \".cursor/hooks/hook.sh\" }],\n    \"stop\": [{ \"command\": \".cursor/hooks/hook.sh\" }],\n    \"afterAgentResponse\": [{ \"command\": \".cursor/hooks/hook.sh\" }]\n  }\n}\nRun the shell command: echo FIRST . Then reply only DONE. If you are told to continue after that, run the shell command: echo SECOND , then reply only DONE2.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1a37f7e9-f778-4ae6-98a2-01287f722a2a","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:13:46.788Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e944c789-93cc-456b-bfef-b3089592515b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/